{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00077",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 9.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "Um, hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.06,
      "end_seconds": 14.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.88,
      "end_seconds": 27.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this. Doctor, it's acne along the jaw. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.14,
      "end_seconds": 31.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.95,
      "end_seconds": 37.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I, I'd say three weeks, you know, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 38.37,
      "end_seconds": 43.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Uh, hm, I'd say more like a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.82,
      "end_seconds": 48.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.88,
      "end_seconds": 54.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Um, um, I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.8,
      "end_seconds": 61.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.77,
      "end_seconds": 73.28,
      "duration_seconds": 11.51,
      "text": "Moderate, really. Hmm, and there's thinning hair on the scalp as well, about four days now. And, And irregular periods, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.72,
      "end_seconds": 78.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Okay, how bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.41,
      "end_seconds": 84.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'd give it a six, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.0,
      "end_seconds": 100.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Any trying for a baby, headaches with vision changes or pelvic pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.18,
      "end_seconds": 106.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.45,
      "end_seconds": 110.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "How about heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.31,
      "end_seconds": 116.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Well, no, I haven't had any heavy bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.26,
      "end_seconds": 124.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.43,
      "end_seconds": 128.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.78,
      "end_seconds": 133.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "So, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.8,
      "end_seconds": 152.36,
      "duration_seconds": 18.56,
      "text": "Okay, so I've had low haemoglobin for two years now. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. Okay, so I have high blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.03,
      "end_seconds": 162.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "Right, so low haemoglobin and high blood pressure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. And your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.65,
      "end_seconds": 167.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.45,
      "end_seconds": 171.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.67,
      "end_seconds": 178.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.34,
      "end_seconds": 181.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "And what do you usually eat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.74,
      "end_seconds": 187.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.07,
      "end_seconds": 205.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "So, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.48,
      "end_seconds": 211.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I mean, you know, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.23,
      "end_seconds": 215.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 217.52,
      "end_seconds": 226.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "It's iron tablets, once a day, doctor. Right, um, she takes ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.96,
      "end_seconds": 232.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Before this I was on amlodipine; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.51,
      "end_seconds": 235.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.94,
      "end_seconds": 240.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 241.77,
      "end_seconds": 251.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Okay, so actually, I remember she had some kind of reaction to aspirin before. I couldn't swear to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.84,
      "end_seconds": 255.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Really? I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.11,
      "end_seconds": 262.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those. Is there a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.68,
      "end_seconds": 270.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones. So, you know, my mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 271.62,
      "end_seconds": 279.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Oxygen saturation is 97 percent, temp 36.5 degrees, pulse 80. Blood pressure 127 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.29,
      "end_seconds": 282.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.37,
      "end_seconds": 287.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.66,
      "end_seconds": 291.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.12,
      "end_seconds": 304.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Facial acne along the jaw and some dark coarse hair on the chin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.84,
      "end_seconds": 312.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "All done, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.54,
      "end_seconds": 342.98,
      "duration_seconds": 23.44,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be possible polycystic ovary syndrome, or it might be a thyroid problem. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had acne along the jaw, moderate, and no heavy bleeding or headaches with vision changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.67,
      "end_seconds": 351.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.5,
      "end_seconds": 375.21,
      "duration_seconds": 22.71,
      "text": "I'll request a pelvic ultrasound, it'll help with irregular periods. I'm going to order a thyroid test, for irregular periods. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Regular exercise and modest weight loss can bring cycles back. I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.86,
      "end_seconds": 380.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I can do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.67,
      "end_seconds": 383.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Call the clinic if you need us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.74,
      "end_seconds": 390.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Hmm, um, okay, thank you. Bye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.42,
      "end_seconds": 393.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Bye for now."
    }
  ]
}